   "author_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/user/63286/turfish",
   "created_at": "2026-07-12T16:51:33+00:00",
   "body_html": "<!--[if BLOCK]><![endif]-->            <p>Hi, I love the mod although I wanted to make it so the rounds fit in the VPO-209, even if they\u2019re designed for just the Gornostay, so I did it. I figured others may also want it so i wanted to put my IIC changes via SVM here for those people.</p>\n<p>If anyone is interested in the same thing, ill put the IIC i made below;</p>\n<pre><code>// Allow the VPO-209 to use the ammo types.\n\n59e6687d86f77411d949b251:Chambers:0:Properties:Filters:0:Filter:+:[766f706800000000000000a3,766f706800000000000000a2,766f706800000000000000a1]\n\n// Base SPT Magazines that fit in the VPO-209\n\n5a01c29586f77474660c694c:Cartridges:0:Properties:Filters:0:Filter:+:[766f706800000000000000a3,766f706800000000000000a2,766f706800000000000000a1]\n5b1fb3e15acfc4001637f068:Cartridges:0:Properties:Filters:0:Filter:+:[766f706800000000000000a3,766f706800000000000000a2,766f706800000000000000a1]\n6272874a6c47bd74f92e2087:Cartridges:0:Properties:Filters:0:Filter:+:[766f706800000000000000a3,766f706800000000000000a2,766f706800000000000000a1]\n64b9cf0ac12b9c38db26923a:Cartridges:0:Properties:Filters:0:Filter:+:[766f706800000000000000a3,766f706800000000000000a2,766f706800000000000000a1]\n59d6272486f77466146386ff:Cartridges:0:Properties:Filters:0:Filter:+:[766f706800000000000000a3,766f706800000000000000a2,766f706800000000000000a1]\n5e21a3c67e40bd02257a008a:Cartridges:0:Properties:Filters:0:Filter:+:[766f706800000000000000a3,766f706800000000000000a2,766f706800000000000000a1]\n5cbdc23eae9215001136a407:Cartridges:0:Properties:Filters:0:Filter:+:[766f706800000000000000a3,766f706800000000000000a2,766f706800000000000000a1]\n5c6175362e221600133e3b94:Cartridges:0:Properties:Filters:0:Filter:+:[766f706800000000000000a3,766f706800000000000000a2,766f706800000000000000a1]\n59fafc5086f7740dbe19f6c3:Cartridges:0:Properties:Filters:0:Filter:+:[766f706800000000000000a3,766f706800000000000000a2,766f706800000000000000a1]\n59fafc9386f774067d462453:Cartridges:0:Properties:Filters:0:Filter:+:[766f706800000000000000a3,766f706800000000000000a2,766f706800000000000000a1]\n5cfe8010d7ad1a59283b14c6:Cartridges:0:Properties:Filters:0:Filter:+:[766f706800000000000000a3,766f706800000000000000a2,766f706800000000000000a1]\n5b1fd4e35acfc40018633c39:Cartridges:0:Properties:Filters:0:Filter:+:[766f706800000000000000a3,766f706800000000000000a2,766f706800000000000000a1]\n59e5d83b86f7745aed03d262:Cartridges:0:Properties:Filters:0:Filter:+:[766f706800000000000000a3,766f706800000000000000a2,766f706800000000000000a1]\n5ac66bea5acfc43b321d4aec:Cartridges:0:Properties:Filters:0:Filter:+:[766f706800000000000000a3,766f706800000000000000a2,766f706800000000000000a1]\n5a0060fc86f7745793204432:Cartridges:0:Properties:Filters:0:Filter:+:[766f706800000000000000a3,766f706800000000000000a2,766f706800000000000000a1]\n\n// WTT - Armory Magazines, only use these if you're using WTT - Armory\n\n59d625f086f774661516605d:Cartridges:0:Properties:Filters:0:Filter:+:[766f706800000000000000a3,766f706800000000000000a2,766f706800000000000000a1]\n6862b3757fa915587fb36148:Cartridges:0:Properties:Filters:0:Filter:+:[766f706800000000000000a3,766f706800000000000000a2,766f706800000000000000a1]\n6862b435bfb984348be4f59b:Cartridges:0:Properties:Filters:0:Filter:+:[766f706800000000000000a3,766f706800000000000000a2,766f706800000000000000a1]\n686096ffbb9dec119f64f4b3:Cartridges:0:Properties:Filters:0:Filter:+:[766f706800000000000000a3,766f706800000000000000a2,766f706800000000000000a1]\n686097621aa8418da42c62eb:Cartridges:0:Properties:Filters:0:Filter:+:[766f706800000000000000a3,766f706800000000000000a2,766f706800000000000000a1]\n6862b46837dc96b767cda666:Cartridges:0:Properties:Filters:0:Filter:+:[766f706800000000000000a3,766f706800000000000000a2,766f706800000000000000a1]\n\n// Ammo IDs for anyone wanting to add them to other magazines possibly.\n\n766f706800000000000000a3 - .366 Match Grade\n766f706800000000000000a2 - .366 Hunter Magnum\n766f706800000000000000a1 - .366 Hunter AP\n